    <briefdescription>
<para>An Iterator for call edges, creates <ref refid="structllvm_1_1_a_a_call_edges" kindref="compound">AACallEdges</ref> attributes in a lazy way. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This iterator becomes invalid if the underlying edge list changes. So This shouldn&apos;t outlive a iteration of <ref refid="structllvm_1_1_attributor" kindref="compound">Attributor</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
